    "text": "15 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2026-07-29 21:58:00 MDT Expires: 2026-07-29 22:08:00 MDT Urgency: Immediate Severity: Severe Certainty: Observed Target Area: Haakon, SD; Jackson, SD; Mellette, SD; Ziebach, SD The storms which prompted the warning have moved east out of the area. Therefore, the warning will be allowed to expire. However, gusty winds and heavy rain are still possible over the next hour.\nIf you observed hail, wind damage, or flooding, please report your observations to the National Weather Service office in Rapid City via phone, email, or social media, as soon as it is safe to do so.",
